    RefIds:
    - rid: 2838372046370505135
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Plural noun: the playfield backgrounds (biomes) the player unlocks and picks from. Shown as a skill''s title group, e.g. "Backgrounds - Enable".'
    - rid: 2838372046370505217
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title group, game term (plural noun): Flipper Bots, floating robots that flip rocks for the player. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Flipper Bots - Max Count".'
    - rid: 2838372046370505218
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L VIII" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L VIII - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505219
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L II" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L II - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505220
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title group, game term: the player''s mouse cursor, used to flip rocks. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Mouse - Radius".'
    - rid: 2838372046370505221
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, the skill applies to rocks of every tier. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "All Rocks - Max HP".
    - rid: 2838372046370505227
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L IV" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L IV - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505228
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L VI" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L VI - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505229
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L X" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L X - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505230
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title group, name of a Monolith (a floating structure at the center of the playfield). "L XII" is its name in Roman numerals; keep it as is. Shown before the skill title, e.g. "Monolith L XII - Unlock".
    - rid: 2838372046370505244
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Backgrounds are the playfield's landscapes, which the player unlocks in the Shop.
    - rid: 2838372046370505245
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The Preferred background is the one background that currently multiplies cash income. Translate "Preferred" the same way as the Preferred label.
    - rid: 2838372046370505246
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} is a multiplier such as x2.5, so it reads "Preferred background: x2.5 cash income." Cash is the game''s money.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505247
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '"it" is the Preferred background''s cash multiplier, shown in the sentence before.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505248
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Tooltip of an item the player hasn't found yet (items drop from chests).
    - rid: 2838372046370505249
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Label in an item's tooltip, followed by the total cash the item has earned so far. Cash is the game's money.
    - rid: 2838372046370505250
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Note at the bottom of an item''s tooltip: the item''s effects get stronger as its level goes up.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505251
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item rarity, the lowest of: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Unique.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505252
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item rarity, the 2nd of: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Unique.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505253
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item rarity, the 3rd of: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Unique.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505254
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item rarity, the 4th of: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Unique.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505255
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item rarity, the highest of: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Unique. Unique items are one of a kind.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505256
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Tooltip of the level progress bar. {0} is an amount of stars with a star icon. Rocks are flipped into the air and land on the ground.
    - rid: 2838372046370505257
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name of the progress bar that drops a chest when it's full.
    - rid: 2838372046370505258
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Tooltip of the Chest Bar. Rocks are flipped into the air and land on the ground.
    - rid: 2838372046370505259
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item name: a pair of dice (the game pieces).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505260
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item name: a hammer (the tool).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505261
